    {
      "id": "7qn1ket",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Dobereiner’s Triads"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rnf3il1",
      "content": "Elements arranged in groups of three."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ncemb8v",
      "content": "Atomic mass of middle element = average of other two."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vodff2k",
      "content": "Limitation: Only few elements followed this rule."
    },
    {
      "id": "8leyz6x",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Newlands’ Law of Octaves"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7qyor3j",
      "content": "Elements arranged in increasing atomic mass."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "d1nlrys",
      "content": "Every eighth element had similar properties."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3bczkiw",
      "content": "Limitation: Worked only up to Calcium."
    },
    {
      "id": "lyfskp9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Mendeleev’s Periodic Law"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "seg1l86",
      "content": "Properties of elements are periodic function of their atomic masses."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "88v8fd9",
      "content": "He left gaps for undiscovered elements."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "t21pa9w",
      "content": "Limitation: Position of hydrogen and isotopes not correct."
    },
    {
      "id": "nkd8cjb",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Modern Periodic Law"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "svyfv1x",
      "content": "Properties of elements are periodic function of their atomic numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h7g7hbc",
      "content": "Modern table arranged by increasing atomic number."
    },
    {
